**Usage:** When a task matches a skill's purpose, read `skill.md` and follow the workflow. Skills are tool-agnostic (Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, opencode, etc.).

**Creating new skills:** Add `.ai/skills/<skill-name>/skill.md`; register in the table above. **Naming:** `.ai/skills/README.md` § Naming protocol (`{domain}-{role}`, kebab-case).

