## UI Design OS (`/mnt/work/Projects/.ai.ui/`)

> **Path note:** `.ai.ui/` is a sibling directory at `/mnt/work/Projects/.ai.ui/` — NOT inside this repo. All paths below use absolute paths for the framework root; `.work.ui/` paths are relative (they live in this repo).

**Coexistence:** [`/mnt/work/Projects/.ai.ui/COHABITATION.md`](/mnt/work/Projects/.ai.ui/COHABITATION.md) — UI skills write to `.work.ui/` only; do not overwrite `.work/plans/NEXT.md` except cross-links.

**Lost on UI?** `/mnt/work/Projects/.ai.ui/START_HERE.md` · **Router:** `@ui-process-router - <question>`

### UI completion gate (addition to Core Principle 7)

UI milestone work is not done until: UI lint/type/tests pass; `@ui-visual-verify` + `@ui-accessibility-audit` pass or are waived in `{HANDOFF_UI}`; agent-assisted UI has `@ui-concept-run - UIS-06` unless **`human-only`** in the same message.

